name: ["Akroma's Memorial", 'Ancient Ziggurat', 'Body Double', "Chainer's Edict", "Devil's Play", "Enchantress's Presence", 'Gempalm Incinerator', 'Gempalm Polluter', 'Honden of Cleansing Fire', 'Honden of Infinite Rage', "Honden of Life's Web", "Honden of Night's Reach", 'Honden of Seeing Winds', 'Krosan Tusker', "Maze's End", "Mirari's Wake", 'Momentary Blink', 'Phyrexian Obliterator', 'Ratchet Bomb', 'Roar of the Wurm', 'Silent Departure', 'Swan Song', 'Tectonic Reformation', 'Tempered Steel', 'Timely Reinforcements', 'Ulamog, the Ceaseless Hunger', 'Unburial Rites']
